  "promptEs": "Lead sheet en Mi♭ mayor. ¿Qué shell voicing realiza el cifrado Bb7 del compás 4?",
  "promptEn": "Lead sheet in Eb major. Which shell voicing realizes the Bb7 symbol in bar 4?",
  "explanationEs": "La respuesta correcta es «Si♭3 + Re4 + La♭4». Bb7 se construye Si♭–Re–Fa–La♭; el shell deja Si♭3 abajo y las guías Re4 (tercera) y La♭4 (séptima) arriba. La tríada Si♭–Re–Fa pierde la séptima; Si♭–Fa–La♭ omite la tercera. En Mi♭ mayor, Bb7 es el dominante y prepara la vuelta a Mi♭.",
  "explanationEn": "The correct answer is “Bb3 + D4 + Ab4”. Bb7 is built from Bb–D–F–Ab; the shell leaves Bb3 at the bottom and the guide tones D4 (third) and Ab4 (seventh) above. The triad Bb–D–F loses the seventh; Bb–F–Ab omits the third. In Eb major, Bb7 is the dominant and prepares the return to Eb.",
